			"description": "| **Endpoint** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| `GET` `/books` | Fetch all books |\n| `GET` `/books/{bookId}` | Fetch a book by book id |\n| `POST` `/books` | Create a new book. For invalid author id in the book object expect an `AuthorNotFoundException` and for other invalid inputs expect an `InvalidInputException` |\n| `PUT` `/books/{bookId}` | Update a book with new data. For invalid author id in the book object expect an `AuthorNotFoundException` and for other invalid inputs expect an `InvalidInputException` |\n| `DELETE` `/books/{bookId}` | Delete a book using book id. For invalid book id, expect a `BookNotFoundException` |\n\nJSON Schema of Book object:\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"title\": \"<Book-Name>\",\n    \"authorId\": <Author-Id>,\n    \"isbn\": \"<ISBN>\",\n    \"publicationYear\": <YEAR>,\n    \"price\": <Price>,\n    \"stock\": <Current-Stock>\n}\n\n ```"
		},
