			"description": "| **Endpoint** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| `GET` `/authors` | Fetch all the authors available |\n| `GET` `/authors/{authorId}` | Featch an author by id. For invalid author id, expect a `AuthorNotFoundException` |\n| `GET` `/authors/{authorId}/books` | Fetch all books for the specified author. For invalid author id, expect a `AuthorNotFoundException` |\n| `POST` `/authors` | Create a new author. For invalid request body expect a `InvalidInputException` |\n| `PUT` `/authors/{authorId}` | Update the author data with author id. For invalid request body expect a `InvalidInputException` and for invalid author id `AuthorNotFoundException` |\n| `DELETE` `/author/{authorId}` | Delete an author using the author id. For invalid author id expect a `AuthorNotFoundException` |\n\nJSON Schema of an Auther object:\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"firstName\": \"<Author-First-Name>\",\n    \"lastName\": \"<Author-Last-Name>\",\n    \"biography\": \"<A-Brief-Biography-of-Author>\"\n}\n\n ```"
