			"description": "| **Endpoint** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| GET `customers/{customerId}/cart` | Feteches all the cart items for the specified customer id (`customerId`) |\n| POST `customers/{customerId}/cart/items` | Add a new item to cart. If success should echo the cart object, else returns `CustomerNotFoundException` (if `customerId` is invalid) |\n| PUT `customers/{customerId}/cart/items/{bookId}` | Updates the quantity of a book id that is already in the cart. Should return an empty response body with status code of `204` . If `bookId` is not available in the cart, then an exception message with type of `CartNotFoundException` |\n| DELETE `customers/{customerId}/cart/items/{bookId}` | Removes a cart item from the cart. If cart item (`bookId`) is not found, an exception message with type of `CartNotFoundException` |\n\nJSON Schema of a Cart object:\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"bookId\": <Book-Id>,\n    \"quantity\": <Quantity>\n}\n\n ```"
