			"description": "| **Endpoint** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| GET `customers/{customerId}/orders` | Fetch all orders for the respective customer id (`customerId`). Returns a list of customer objects |\n| GET `customers/{customerId}/orders/{orderId}` | Get an order by order id for a given customer id. Returns a single order object if got success, else returns an exception with the type of `OrderNotFoundException` |\n| POST `customers/{customerId}/orders` | Creates an order using the customers existing cart. If success, returns the order object else returns an exception with type of `CartNotFoundException` |\n\nJSON Schema for Order object:\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"id\": <Order-Id>,\n    \"customerId\": <Customer-Id>,\n    \"items\": [\n        {\n            \"bookId\": <Book-ID>,\n            \"quantity\": <Quantity>\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n ```"
